    "node tools/osd-sxml-contract.mjs writes src/sxml/zcl_osd_sxml_fixtures.clas.abap, the A4H recorder and its",
    "in-repo twin from it. input: strings are UTF-8 encoded, {hex} parts are raw bytes.",
    "status provisional-fork: expected generated from the pinned oisee/open-abap-core (libs.lock.json) through",
    "ZCL_OSD_SXML_FACTORY_CONCAT by 'osd-sxml-contract.mjs provisional'; NOT an oracle.",
    "status provisional-spec: written by hand from the XML 1.0 / JSON-XML rules where the fork is visibly wrong ('spec' says why).",
    "status measured-a4h-<date>: measured on A4H with the real CL_SXML_STRING_READER; 'measured' says which",
    "part was measured, the rest of the lines are derived.",
    "Every provisional expectation is replaced by the A4H recording (osd-sxml-contract.mjs import).",
    "fork: what the pinned fork does (set by 'provisional'): absent = passes, MISS = another sequence, DUMPS = a",
    "runtime error no CATCH sees. Where the fork and A4H differ, that is an ANORMALIES entry, not an edit of the expectation."
